  "releaseNotes": "Adds NavPage navigation with retained card tabs, optional right header and compiled model bindings. Adds tab icons, pinned pages and close menus; pinned pages cannot move or close. Animates NavMenu expansion. Separates MultiSelectBox search from source/subscription rebuilds and adds WorkflowEditor graph indexes, viewport caches and safe offscreen view recycling. Contains popup wheel, touch and inertia input without scrolling outer pages. Requires .NET 10 and Avalonia 12.1.4; upgrade TheOne.Avalonia.DataGrid to the same preview version.",
